          ai: 'Game: Follow the Queen (Seven Card Stud variant). Deal: 2 down, 4 up, 1 down across 7 streets. Wild cards: All Queens are wild. After any Queen is dealt face-up, the rank of the immediately following up-card becomes wild for all players. Wild status shifts if another Queen appears. Hand rankings: Five-of-a-Kind is highest (beats Royal Flush). Betting: Each street has a betting round. Win: Highest 5-card Poker hand at showdown.',
